<h2>Install Jaeger GUI</h2>
<div class="highlight"><pre><span></span><code>$ paru -S aur/jaeger-all-in-one-bin
</code></pre></div>

<p>Run it with:</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre><span></span><code>$ /usr/bin/jaeger-all-in-one
</code></pre></div>

<p>Now, you can go to http://localhost:16686/search to view your local
app telemetry.</p>